regression = "Each proving test requires its recipient-bearing fixture in the existing ROUTES matrix before driving parseRouteQuery, serializeRoute, the real deep-link listener, browser history and the remounted route hook; without the matrix additions each fixture assertion fails. The serializer fix is already present from prerequisite 22.31.249."
